; Included by Tauri's NSIS template before the installer pages are defined.

; Welcome page text with the anonymous download count notice
!define MUI_WELCOMEPAGE_TEXT "Setup will guide you through the installation of $(^NameDA).$\r$\n$\r$\nPrivacy notice: Unusual only counts how many times it has been downloaded and updated, as a single anonymous number (the public download counter of the GitHub release). No personal data, usage data or identifiers are collected.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Next to continue."
